msgstr "Encontrado"

msgid ""
"Found: a bright two-note chime. You picked out the right bird, or counted a "
"flock exactly."
msgstr ""
"Encontrado: un tintineo brillante de dos notas. Elegiste el pájaro "
"correcto, o contaste una bandada exacta."

msgid "Trail's end"
msgstr "Final del sendero"

msgid ""
"Trail's end: a gentle rising chord. You reached the end of the trail, or "
"the last flock has gone."
msgstr ""
"Final del sendero: un acorde suave que sube. Llegaste al final del sendero, "
"o se fue la última bandada."

msgid "Wingbeats"
msgstr "Aleteos"

msgid "Wingbeats: a soft rush of wings. A migrating flock is coming."
msgstr "Aleteos: un batir suave de alas. Viene una bandada migratoria."

