"alrededor."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Midsummer night."
msgstr "Noche de pleno verano."

#. placeholders: {FLASHES}, {p}, {ROUNDS}
msgid ""
"Midsummer night. A bonfire burns in the middle of the meadow, and the "
"fireflies gather round it. They flash together, {FLASHES} flashes in a row, "
"then rest. Some drift out of step and flash a moment late. Press {p} with "
"each flash to bring a straggler back into the chorus. The show lasts "
"{ROUNDS} rounds."
msgstr ""
"Noche de pleno verano. Una hoguera arde en medio del prado, y las "
"luciérnagas se reúnen a su alrededor. Destellan a la vez, {FLASHES} "
"destellos seguidos, y luego descansan. Algunas pierden el paso y destellan "
"un momento tarde. Pulsa {p} con cada destello para devolver a una rezagada "
"al coro. El espectáculo dura {ROUNDS} rondas."

