msgid ""
"Hearts card: a paper slide with a warm low bell. Every hearts card you "
"reach or pick up."
msgstr ""
"Carta de corazones: un roce de papel con una campana cálida y grave. Cada "
"carta de corazones que alcanzas o coges."

msgid "Diamonds card: a paper slide with a bright high bell."
msgstr "Carta de diamantes: un roce de papel con una campana viva y aguda."

msgid "Clubs card: a paper slide with a soft wooden knock."
msgstr "Carta de tréboles: un roce de papel con un golpe suave de madera."

msgid "Spades card: a paper slide with a deep wooden knock."
msgstr "Carta de picas: un roce de papel con un golpe hondo de madera."

msgid "Card flip: a face-down card turns face up. Its name follows."
msgstr ""
"Giro de carta: una carta boca abajo se pone boca arriba. Luego oyes su "
"nombre."

msgid "Soft tap: the cards you held are placed."
msgstr "Toque suave: las cartas que tenías quedan colocadas."

msgid ""
"Muffled thud: the cards cannot go there. The reason follows, and you keep "
"holding them."
msgstr ""
"Golpe sordo: las cartas no pueden ir ahí. Luego oyes el motivo, y sigues "
"con ellas en la mano."

msgid ""
"Stock turn: a card is turned up from the stock, or the stock is refilled."
msgstr ""
"Giro del mazo: se descubre una carta del mazo, o el mazo se rellena."

msgid "Foundation chime: a suit is complete, ace to king."
msgstr "Campanilla de base: un palo está completo, del as al rey."

msgid ""
"Row chime: you cross from the piles to the stock, or from the stock to the "
"foundations."
msgstr ""
"Campanilla de fila: pasas de las pilas al mazo, o del mazo a las bases."

msgid "Undo swish: the last move is taken back."
msgstr "Silbido de deshacer: se deshace el último movimiento."

msgid "Dull tap: nothing to do there just now."
msgstr "Toque apagado: ahí no hay nada que hacer ahora."

msgid "Return to the Fireside Patience title."
msgstr "Volver al menú principal de Fireside Patience."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Find the ace of hearts."
msgstr "Encuentra el as de corazones."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Seven piles, stock, then four foundations."
