"A pile builds down in alternating colours: a black 7 goes on a red 8. Move "
"the 7 of spades from pile 3 onto the 8 of diamonds on pile 2."
msgstr ""
"Una pila baja en colores alternos: un 7 negro va sobre un 8 rojo. Mueve el "
