msgid ""
"A game of patience by the fire: put all 52 cards on the four foundations, "
"by suit, from ace to king. There is no clock and no way to lose. Learn on a "
"small table"
msgstr ""
"Un solitario junto al fuego: pon las 52 cartas en las cuatro bases, por "
"palo, del as al rey. No hay reloj ni forma de perder. Aprende en una mesa "
"pequeña"

