msgstr "Pedalea hasta {per_hour}, luego frena hasta parar."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The brakes build over a moment, so start early."
msgstr "Los frenos tardan un momento en apretar, así que empieza pronto."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "A line divides the bike lane from the traffic lane."
msgstr "Una línea separa el carril bici del carril de tráfico."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Get moving, steer out into the traffic lane, then back into the bike lane."
msgstr "Arranca, sal al carril de tráfico y luego vuelve al carril bici."

