msgid "the graveyard gate"
msgstr "la verja del cementerio"

msgid ""
"A rusty gate, a few loose headstones, and the first monsters to hear about "
"the new dance."
msgstr ""
"Una verja oxidada, unas lápidas sueltas y los primeros monstruos que oyen "
"hablar del nuevo baile."

msgid "the crypt"
msgstr "la cripta"

msgid ""
"Down the steps into the family crypt, where the dripping ceiling keeps time."
msgstr ""
"Escaleras abajo hasta la cripta familiar, donde el techo que gotea marca el "
"tiempo."

msgid "the old church"
msgstr "la vieja iglesia"

msgid ""
"The ruined church on the hill, with bats in the bell tower and a full moon "
"through the roof."
msgstr ""
"La iglesia en ruinas de la colina, con murciélagos en el campanario y la "
"luna llena por el tejado."

msgid "Doctor Volt's laboratory"
msgstr "el laboratorio de Doctor Volt"

msgid ""
"The laboratory where the dance began, with the lightning rods crackling and "
"every monster in town."
msgstr ""
"El laboratorio donde empezó el baile, con los pararrayos chisporroteando y "
"todos los monstruos del pueblo."

msgid ""
"Count: a coffin lid knock. Four of them count you in before each song, and "
"three after a pause."
msgstr ""
"Cuenta: un golpe en una tapa de ataúd. Cuatro te dan la entrada antes de "
"cada canción, y tres tras una pausa."

msgid ""
"Spot on: a small spooky chime with your move. It landed right on the beat."
msgstr ""
"Perfecto: una campanilla pequeña y siniestra con tu paso. Cayó justo en el "
"tiempo."

msgid ""
"Close: a soft dull tick with your move. It landed in time, but a little "
"early or late."
msgstr ""
"Casi: un tic suave y apagado con tu paso. Cayó a tiempo, pero un poco "
"pronto o tarde."

msgid ""
"Stumble: a thud and a clatter of bones. A move was missed, or the wrong "
"move was danced."
msgstr ""
"Tropiezo: un golpe y un estrépito de huesos. Fallaste un paso, o bailaste "
"el equivocado."

msgid ""
"Bony claps: the crowd claps three times. Another 8 moves in a row, for a "
"bonus."
msgstr ""
"Palmas huesudas: el público aplaude tres veces. Otros 8 pasos seguidos, con "
"puntos extra."

msgid "Applause: the end of a song, with howls and rattles."
msgstr "Aplausos: el final de una canción, con aullidos y traqueteos."

#. placeholders: {word}, {call_words}, {dance}, {move_words}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{word}: {call_words}, then its move, {dance}: {move_words}."
msgstr "{word}: {call_words}, luego su paso, {dance}: {move_words}."

#. placeholders: {word}, {call_words}, {dance}, {move_words}, {sentence_start}
msgid ""
"{word}: {call_words}, then its move, {dance}: {move_words}. "
"{sentence_start} dances it."
msgstr ""
"{word}: {call_words}, luego su paso, {dance}: {move_words}. "
"{sentence_start} lo baila."

#. placeholders: {word}, {call_words}, {move_words}
msgid "{word}: {call_words}, then {move_words}."
msgstr "{word}: {call_words}, luego {move_words}."

msgid "Here comes the band."
msgstr "Aquí llega la banda."

