#. placeholders: {CANDLES}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{CANDLES} floors from floor 1 with the lights out and restless ghosts, and "
"courage that lasts the night."
msgstr ""
"{CANDLES} plantas desde la planta 1 con las luces apagadas y fantasmas "
"inquietos, y un valor que dura toda la noche."

#. placeholders: {CANDLES}, {candles_words}
msgid ""
"{CANDLES} floors from floor 1 with the lights out and restless ghosts, and "
