msgstr "Cada farolillo suena una vez, el más cercano primero."

msgid "Tab: head home and end the night. You are asked first."
msgstr "Tab: volver a casa y terminar la noche. Antes te lo pregunta."

msgid "Tab: head home and end the night."
msgstr "Tab: volver a casa y terminar la noche."

msgid "You are asked first."
msgstr "Antes te lo pregunta."

msgid ""
"S: status. How many lanterns you have and roughly where the nearest one is. "
