msgid ""
"You drift up to an old wooden dock. Its boards creak, and water slaps "
"softly against the posts."
msgstr ""
"Llegas flotando a un viejo embarcadero de madera. Sus tablas crujen, y el "
"agua golpea suave los postes."

msgid ""
"Your canoe nudges a small rocky island. High in a pine, an owl watches you "
"and hoots."
msgstr ""
"Tu canoa roza una pequeña isla rocosa. En lo alto de un pino, un búho te "
"mira y ulula."

msgid ""
"Fireflies rise from a meadow on the shore, hundreds of them, blinking over "
"the water."
msgstr ""
"Las luciérnagas se elevan de un prado de la orilla, cientos de ellas, "
"parpadeando sobre el agua."

msgid "A little stream tumbles into the lake here, bubbling over stones."
msgstr "Un arroyo cae al lago aquí, burbujeando sobre las piedras."

msgid ""
"You glide into a patch of lily pads. A bullfrog grumbles and plops into the "
"water."
msgstr "Te deslizas entre nenúfares. Una rana toro gruñe y se tira al agua."

msgid ""
"An old bell buoy rocks gently, and its bell rings low across the lake."
msgstr ""
"Una vieja boya con campana se mece despacio, y su campana suena grave por "
"el lago."

msgid ""
"A beaver lodge of sticks and mud. Something inside gnaws, then slaps its "
"tail on the water."
msgstr ""
"Una madriguera de castores de palos y barro. Algo roe dentro, y luego da un "
"coletazo en el agua."

msgid ""
"A weeping willow trails its branches in the water, whispering as you pass "
"beneath."
msgstr ""
"Un sauce llorón arrastra sus ramas en el agua, susurrando cuando pasas "
"debajo."

