#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {right}, {sentence_start2}, {sentence_start3}, {sentence_start4}, {sentence_start5}, {sentence_start6}, {sentence_start7}, {sentence_start8}
msgid ""
"On the lake. {sentence_start} and {right} turn the canoe: press briefly for "
"a little, hold to keep turning. {sentence_start2} paddles a stroke; hold it "
"to keep paddling. {sentence_start3} back-paddles to slow down. "
"{sentence_start4} looks around and rings every lantern once. "
"{sentence_start5} heads home and ends the night. {sentence_start6} says "
"your lanterns and where the nearest one is. {sentence_start7} repeats the "
"last thing said. {sentence_start8} says which way to turn. Escape pauses."
msgstr ""
"En el lago. {sentence_start} y {right} giran la canoa: pulsa brevemente "
"para un poco, mantén para seguir girando. {sentence_start2} da una palada; "
"mantenla para seguir remando. {sentence_start3} rema hacia atrás para "
"frenar. {sentence_start4} mira alrededor y hace sonar cada farolillo una "
"vez. {sentence_start5} vuelve a casa y termina la noche. {sentence_start6} "
"dice tus farolillos y dónde está el más cercano. {sentence_start7} repite "
"lo último dicho. {sentence_start8} dice hacia dónde girar. Escape pausa."

