msgstr "el Capitán solo, {CAPTAIN_LANDINGS} paradas"

msgid ""
"One saloon night against the Widow, the Gambler and the Captain. Your score "
"is your night total."
msgstr ""
"Una noche de salón contra la Viuda, el Tahúr y el Capitán. Tu puntuación es "
"tu total de la noche."

msgid ""
"Three saloon nights. Snag rule: a double 1 wipes the night total of "
"everyone still seated. Your score is the total from all three nights."
msgstr ""
"Tres noches de salón. Regla del tropiezo: un doble 1 borra el total de la "
"noche de todos los que siguen sentados. Tu puntuación es el total de las "
"tres noches."

#. placeholders: {CAPTAIN_LANDINGS}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"A night of {CAPTAIN_LANDINGS} landings at the Captain's table, you and the "
