msgstr "El jardín de hoy"

msgid "This week's garden"
msgstr "El jardín de la semana"

msgid "The rooftop festival"
msgstr "La fiesta de la azotea"

msgid ""
"Up and Down choose a challenge, Enter reads its goal and twist, Escape goes "
"back. Every player gets the same garden: a new daily each day, a weekly "
"each Monday and a festival each month."
msgstr ""
"Up y Down eligen un desafío, Enter lee su objetivo y su giro, Escape "
"vuelve. Todos tienen el mismo jardín: un diario cada día, un semanal cada "
"lunes y una fiesta cada mes."

msgid "Opening the Rooftop Garden challenge."
msgstr "Abriendo el desafío de Rooftop Garden."

msgid "The seed shed"
msgstr "El cobertizo de semillas"

msgid ""
"Every kind of seed, your varieties, keepsakes and requests. Up and Down "
"read them, Escape goes back."
msgstr ""
"Cada tipo de semilla, tus variedades, recuerdos y pedidos. Up y Down los "
"leen, Escape vuelve."

