msgid "No requests. Neighbours ask as the days go by."
msgstr "No hay pedidos. Los vecinos piden según pasan los días."

msgid ""
"What your neighbours would like from your harvests. Each one filled earns a "
"star."
msgstr ""
"Lo que a tus vecinos les gustaría de tus cosechas. Cada pedido cumplido "
"gana una estrella."

msgid "Return to the Rooftop Garden title."
msgstr "Volver al menú principal de Rooftop Garden."

msgid "Varieties found"
