msgid "Slow Kettle"
msgstr "Slow Kettle"

msgid ""
"Up and Down choose a challenge, Enter reads its briefing, Escape goes back. "
"Every player gets the same guests: new ones each day, each Monday and each "
"month."
msgstr ""
"Up y Down eligen un desafío, Enter lee su resumen, Escape vuelve. Todos "
"reciben los mismos clientes: nuevos cada día, cada lunes y cada mes."

