#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} sends a sonar ping. Everything nearby echoes from its true "
"direction, and far things echo later. Ping now."
msgstr ""
"{sentence_start} lanza un ping de sonar. Todo lo cercano devuelve el eco "
"desde su dirección real, y lo lejano tarda más. Lanza un ping ahora."

msgid "The chest is on your right."
msgstr "El cofre está a tu derecha."

#. one sentence of a longer line
