msgid "The chest is ahead of you."
msgstr "El cofre está delante de ti."

msgid ""
"Mines warn you when you are near, and touching one costs hull. One lies "
"south of you. Ping to find it."
msgstr ""
"Las minas te avisan cuando estás cerca, y tocar una cuesta casco. Hay una "
"al sur de ti. Lanza un ping para encontrarla."

msgid "You found that mine already, the hard way."
msgstr "Esa mina ya la encontraste, por las malas."

msgid "That was the mine."
msgstr "Esa era la mina."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Swim back to it."
msgstr "Vuelve nadando hasta ella."

#. placeholders: {s}
