msgid "Reach this crossing in a skyline run or finish the one before it."
msgstr ""
"Llega a esta travesía en la ruta de los tejados o termina la anterior."

msgid "Return to the Tightrope title."
msgstr "Volver al menú principal de Tightrope."

msgid "Tightrope"
msgstr "Tightrope"

msgid "Balance tone"
msgstr "Tono de equilibrio"

msgid ""
"The tone that is your balance, at each lean in turn: it moves to the side "
"you lean to and rises as you lean further."
msgstr ""
"El tono que marca tu equilibrio, en cada inclinación por turno: se mueve "
"hacia el lado al que te inclinas y sube cuanto más te inclinas."

msgid "furthest"
msgstr ""

msgid "training"
msgstr ""

