msgstr "Midnight Countdown: {name}."

#. placeholders: {name}, {primary}, {key}, {key2}
msgid ""
"Midnight Countdown: {name}. Ten minutes to midnight, and the full orchestra "
"is here from the first call. The band plays a one-bar call; answer it in "
"the next bar, on the same beats. Bells are {primary}, the drum is {key}, "
"the horn is {key2}. The party starts at full energy; misses drain it. Press "
"{primary} to start. A bar counts you in."
msgstr ""
"Midnight Countdown: {name}. Son las doce menos diez, y toda la orquesta "
"está aquí desde la primera llamada. La banda toca una llamada de un compás; "
"respóndela en el compás siguiente, en los mismos tiempos. Las campanas son "
"{primary}, el tambor es {key}, la trompeta es {key2}. La fiesta empieza con "
"toda la energía; los fallos la gastan. Pulsa {primary} para empezar. Un "
"compás te da la entrada."

#. placeholders: {primary}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Press {primary} to start."
msgstr "Pulsa {primary} para empezar."

